Changes from the original: the plugin is renamed blast-radius -> pulse-blast-radius
in .claude-plugin/plugin.json.

Modified by MrValraven in version 0.3.0 of pulse-mods, in these areas: the command
reading (a quote-aware splitter in hooks/split.mjs, and the classifier moved to
hooks/classify.mjs with new file, git, database and infrastructure patterns and
the wrappers it reads through), measuring every risky part of a command line,
the nothing-to-discard pass, the pane layout and the pulse palette, the band
notification, the /blast-radius decision log and help, the measureMigrations
setting, the tests in tests/, the README and the plugin manifest.
